    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>correct algebraic manipulation involving <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V_{g}\"></span> = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\\frac{GM}{r}\"></span> AND g = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{GM}{r^{2}}\"></span> ✔   e.g. <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\\frac{GM}{r^{2}}\"></span> × <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\"></span> = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\\frac{GM}{r}\"></span> OR <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\\frac{GM}{r}\"></span> = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{GM}{r^{2}}\"></span><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\"></span></p>\n</section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b.i\"><p><strong>b.i</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V_{g}\"></span> = −4.0 × 10<sup>7</sup> « J kg<sup>−1</sup> » ✔ g = « <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\\frac{V_{g}}{r}= \\frac{4.0 \\times  10^{7}}{1.0 \\times  10^{7}}\"></span> =» 4.0 «m s<sup>−2</sup>» ✔</p>\n<p>Using the tangent to the graph is acceptable Award [2] for BCA</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b.ii\"><p><strong>b.ii</strong></p><p>F = «750×4.0» = 3000 «N» ✔</p>\n<p>750 × (value in 8bi) for ECF</p>\n</section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c.i\"><p><strong>c.i</strong></p><p>change in the orbital radius is very small compared with the original radius / new radius is approximately the same as the original radius ✔</p>\n<p>« Since g=−<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V_{g}\"></span>/<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\"></span>, » very small change in r means a very small change in g / (∆(<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V_{g}\"></span>/<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\"></span>) is almost zero ✔</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c.ii\"><p><strong>c.ii</strong></p><p>ALTERNATIVE 1 ∆E<sub>p</sub> =«mg∆<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\"></span> =»750 × 4.0 × 2.0 × 10<sup>3</sup> OR 6.0 × 10<sup>6</sup> «J» ✔</p>\n<p>∆E<sub>k</sub> =<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\\frac{1}{2}\"></span>∆E<sub>p</sub> OR ∆E = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\"></span>∆E<sub>p</sub> ✔</p>\n<p>∆E = 3.0 × 10<sup>6</sup> «J» ✔</p>\n<p>ALTERNATIVE 2 mass of Earth = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4.0\\times 10^{7}\\times 1.0\\times 10^{7}}{6.67\\times 10^{-11}}\"></span>= 6.0 × 10<sup>24</sup> «kg» ✔</p>\n<p>∆E= <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\"></span> × 6.67 × 10<sup>−11</sup> × 6.0 × 10<sup>24</sup> ×750 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{1.0\\times 10^{7}}-\\frac{1}{1.0\\times 10^{7}+2.0\\times 10^{3}}\"></span> ✔</p>\n<p>∆E = 3.0 × 10<sup>6</sup> «J» ✔</p>\n<p>Award [3] for BCA</p></section>"
